cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "IMOS_pipeline: nightly mirror of the IMOS/AODN S3 data bucket to NCI"
abstract: >-
  A nightly pipeline that mirrors the public IMOS/AODN data bucket on AWS S3
  (s3://imos-data) to the National Computational Infrastructure (NCI),
  Australia, driven by the bucket's daily S3 Inventory.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hollmann
    given-names: Hannes
    affiliation: "National Computational Infrastructure, The Australian National University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/partypeter/IMOS_pipeline"
license: GPL-3.0-only
date-released: "2026-10-14"
keywords:
  - IMOS
  - AODN
  - NCI
  - data mirroring
  - AWS S3
